        "savings_residuals": {
          "reason": "Acts done and liabilities incurred under the approved code before June 14, 1935 are accrued; the NIRA section 5 antitrust exemption for action complying with the code during the period is an accrued effect for past action only. The proviso in section 2 of the resolution limits the section 5 exemption to agreements and action thereunder that put section 7(a) requirements into effect or prohibit practices already unlawful, names agreements rather than codes and states no time limit, and the held text does not settle whether it narrowed the exemption for past action. Nothing held continues the approval after June 14, 1935.",
